WEBVTT

01:25.480 --> 01:26.690
Koume-chan.

01:29.980 --> 01:30.740
Koume-chan.

01:30.740 --> 01:32.410
Oh, Mama.

01:32.410 --> 01:34.870
If you want a snack, Mommy's bought something else for you.

01:34.870 --> 01:35.360
See?

01:35.940 --> 01:38.570
It's organic green pea powder, additive-free Kuzumochi.

01:38.570 --> 01:39.110
Okay.

01:39.110 --> 01:40.120
Let's hurry, okay?

01:40.120 --> 01:41.080
Okay.

01:42.950 --> 01:45.290
No, Ruu-chama.

01:48.710 --> 01:52.960
Ruu-chama, I can't buy you that many. Please choose just one.

01:53.380 --> 01:56.560
I know. You want the golden lion, right?

01:56.560 --> 01:57.880
But I'm afraid you can only have one.

01:57.880 --> 01:59.510
Choose one.

02:02.260 --> 02:03.770
Is that the one you want?

02:03.770 --> 02:06.310
Okay, please put the rest back on the shelf.

02:07.730 --> 02:09.400
You're a good boy, Ruu-chama.

02:16.190 --> 02:17.820
We sure did buy a lot, didn't we?

02:20.320 --> 02:22.030
Why it's the golden lion.

02:22.370 --> 02:24.490
You're amazing, Ruu-chama.

02:25.490 --> 02:27.710
As expected of you.

02:27.710 --> 02:32.670
Wonderful... to guess correctly which one had the golden lion I wanted.

02:33.130 --> 02:35.210
So he's called Ruu-kun.

02:35.670 --> 02:37.090
He's wonderful...

02:37.720 --> 02:39.680
Koume-chan, where did you go?

02:39.680 --> 02:40.810
I was looking for you.

02:40.810 --> 02:43.100
Ah! I-I-I'm sorry!

02:43.100 --> 02:45.520
Well, let's hurry on home.

02:45.520 --> 02:48.310
The afternoon medical examinations are going to start soon.

02:49.730 --> 02:50.570
What's wrong?

02:50.570 --> 02:53.740
Mama, can I play outside?

02:53.740 --> 02:54.860
What? But...

02:54.860 --> 02:58.490
It'll be fine. I'll be home by my curfew.

02:58.490 --> 03:00.320
Please don't worry.

03:01.160 --> 03:04.030
Is that so? Well, be careful.

03:04.780 --> 03:08.500
Since Koume-chan's such a good girl, Mommy will trust you, okay?

03:08.500 --> 03:09.200
Yup!

03:09.540 --> 03:11.380
Then, Mommy's leaving, okay?

03:11.380 --> 03:12.720
I need to hurry!

03:12.720 --> 03:15.040
Koume promises to be careful!

03:17.380 --> 03:20.010
I won't let you get away!

03:23.010 --> 03:24.720
It's fast! So fast!

03:28.850 --> 03:29.640
We're finally here...

03:29.930 --> 03:32.350
Oh? This is a temple.

03:32.940 --> 03:34.190
I'm home.

03:35.360 --> 03:36.770
Welcome back.

03:37.570 --> 03:41.070
Ruu-chama's amazing! He got the golden lion.

03:41.990 --> 03:43.460
That's amazing.

03:43.460 --> 03:45.750
What are you two doing?

03:45.750 --> 03:50.050
Well, when we came back from school I was starving...

03:50.050 --> 03:51.380
So we ordered a pizza.

03:51.380 --> 03:53.920
Oh? Isn't that great?

03:53.920 --> 03:55.260
Let's eat it together.

03:55.260 --> 03:56.960
I'm looking forward to it.

03:57.590 --> 03:58.760
Ah! It's here!

03:58.760 --> 03:59.390
Coming!

03:59.390 --> 04:00.510
Money! Money!

04:00.510 --> 04:03.340
My, aren't you two fast.

04:04.760 --> 04:10.610
This is the first time we've met. I'm Yumenokouji Koume.

04:10.610 --> 04:11.980
Nice to meet you.

04:11.980 --> 04:15.360
Oh, nice to meet you too. I'm Saionji Kanata.

04:15.360 --> 04:16.910
And I'm Kouzuki Miyu.

04:16.910 --> 04:21.440
Miyu-san, Kanata-san, I've finished setting up the plates for the pizza.

04:21.440 --> 04:22.740
Pizza, pizza...

04:25.320 --> 04:29.170
Wanya, transform. There's someone here to see Ruu-kun.

04:29.170 --> 04:31.370
What? Wanya!

04:31.750 --> 04:35.870
Peach tree, peach tree nursery...

04:37.840 --> 04:41.680
My, what an ugly tricycle.

04:41.680 --> 04:44.560
I'd like to see the kid who's happy to ride in this thing.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.850
Actually, I don't.

04:46.850 --> 04:49.390
There's no way that kid can be my friend, anyway.

04:50.470 --> 04:55.390
I wonder if the owner of the tricycle is visiting Ruu?

04:56.480 --> 04:59.610
I came here to meet Ruu-kun.

05:00.770 --> 05:05.540
She's from the Yumenokouji Medical Clinic near the Tarafuku Supermarket.

05:05.540 --> 05:07.620
Oh, I know that place.

05:07.620 --> 05:10.000
So you're their daughter, right?

05:10.000 --> 05:12.120
So, why do you want to see Ruu?

05:12.370 --> 05:14.060
Um, yes...

05:14.060 --> 05:17.130
Onii-tan, Onee-tan, big Onii-tan...

05:17.130 --> 05:19.920
Thank goodness! I'm not "Oba-tan."

05:19.920 --> 05:24.340
If it's okay with you, I'd like to talk to Ruu-kun.

05:24.340 --> 05:26.340
We don't have a problem with that.

05:27.840 --> 05:30.550
Um... Ruu-kun,

05:30.550 --> 05:32.970
I... I...

05:35.560 --> 05:41.400
I love you! Please go out with me!

05:41.400 --> 05:42.320
What?!

05:43.900 --> 05:47.960
I've loved you since the first time I saw you.

05:47.960 --> 05:50.830
It's the first time I've ever felt this way.

05:50.830 --> 05:56.410
Because it's you, I'm willing to give you my precious "Angel Piki Piki" sticker.

05:56.410 --> 06:00.630
I'll even add the "Good Boy Sunflower" badge as a bonus.

06:00.630 --> 06:03.170
That's how much I love you!

06:03.170 --> 06:05.510
Ruu-chama's so popular!

06:05.630 --> 06:09.810
Hey, Wanya, this isn't the right time to be saying such carefree things.

06:09.810 --> 06:13.110
That's right. What if Momoka-chan comes in...

06:13.110 --> 06:14.600
Please excuse me.

06:15.180 --> 06:18.350
My darling Ruu.

06:18.350 --> 06:20.150
Ah! It's Momoka-chan!

06:22.610 --> 06:25.910
Don't act so friendly with my Ruu-kun.

06:25.910 --> 06:27.580
You have really bad manners.

06:27.580 --> 06:28.580
What?

06:28.580 --> 06:32.030
You opened the shoji door, but didn't close it.

06:32.490 --> 06:38.080
Didn't your Mama and Papa ever teach you to close the door after you've opened it?

06:34.030 --> 06:36.950
Ruu-chama, let's stay over here for a bit, okay?

06:38.080 --> 06:41.880
Are you fine with keeping it wide open like that?

06:41.880 --> 06:45.850
Girls with such bad manners are just the lowest of the low.

06:45.850 --> 06:48.010
Of course, that applies to boys too.

06:49.380 --> 06:51.390
I was just about to close it!

06:52.720 --> 06:54.770
See? I closed it properly myself.

06:54.770 --> 06:56.890
Momoka isn't the lowest of the low.

06:56.890 --> 06:59.640
Oh? That just makes you normal.

07:02.350 --> 07:08.620
I'm Hanakomachi Momoka, three years old, from the Peach Tree Nursery, Peach group three.

07:08.620 --> 07:11.910
Ruu and I have been together for a long<i> time.</i>

07:11.910 --> 07:14.700
There's no room for you.

07:15.030 --> 07:16.580
None at all!

07:17.750 --> 07:19.340
Nice to meet you.

07:19.340 --> 07:24.970
My name is Yumenokouji Koume, three years old, from the Plum Tree Nursery, Plum group three.

07:24.970 --> 07:28.260
It doesn't matter how long you two have been together.

07:28.260 --> 07:31.220
What's important is love. Love is all that matters.

07:31.550 --> 07:32.680
What did you say?!

07:33.260 --> 07:34.180
It's all that matters.

07:36.930 --> 07:39.400
Oh, my... you can cut the air with a knife...

07:39.400 --> 07:41.850
Ruu-chama's fallen asleep.

07:43.980 --> 07:44.660
It's the pizza!

07:44.660 --> 07:47.160
The pizza's here. Let's eat it all together!

07:47.160 --> 07:48.530
Yay! Yay!

07:48.530 --> 07:51.110
Look, I'm closing the shoji door!

07:51.860 --> 07:53.500
See? It's pizza.

07:53.500 --> 07:54.820
Let's eat.

07:58.700 --> 08:00.200
Bon appétit!

08:02.710 --> 08:05.750
Why are they staring at each other while eating pizza?

08:08.710 --> 08:09.460
I know.

08:09.880 --> 08:12.810
Wanya, bring the hot stuff.

08:12.810 --> 08:14.690
What? This?

08:14.690 --> 08:16.940
But this is really hot.

08:16.940 --> 08:18.980
Just give it to me.

08:18.980 --> 08:20.270
Take that! And this! And that!

08:22.560 --> 08:26.110
Because I love Ruu, I can easily eat this.

08:33.070 --> 08:33.990
Yummy!

08:37.490 --> 08:39.120
For me, this is nothing!

08:44.210 --> 08:47.300
I-It's okay. It looks yummy.

08:47.300 --> 08:48.840
Stop it.

08:48.840 --> 08:52.640
Children shouldn't eat this. It's bad for you.

08:52.640 --> 08:53.850
It looks hot...

08:53.850 --> 08:56.350
My nose can really feel that...

08:56.350 --> 08:58.890
Momoka-chan, you too. Don't be so reckless.

08:58.890 --> 09:00.350
Okay...

09:02.310 --> 09:05.060
Oh, Ruu-chama, you're sleepy, aren't you?

09:06.850 --> 09:11.280
Ruu, I'll sing you a lullaby, just like always.

09:11.280 --> 09:15.280
If it's a lullaby, I can sing you a wonderful song.

09:32.710 --> 09:33.840
That's enough!

09:35.840 --> 09:38.770
Now, now, Ruu-chama, it's all right.

09:38.770 --> 09:40.760
Let's go sleep over there, shall we?

09:43.430 --> 09:45.400
This is all your weird song's fault.

09:45.400 --> 09:47.350
Yours is weirder.

09:48.810 --> 09:49.990
Now, now, no fighting.

09:49.990 --> 09:51.520
You should be friendly with each other.

09:51.520 --> 09:55.740
You're right. Only bad kids fight.

09:55.740 --> 10:01.030
But... I want to be allowed to go out with Ruu-kun.

10:01.910 --> 10:04.120
What are you talking about?

10:04.120 --> 10:06.040
Now, hold on a second.

10:06.540 --> 10:07.290
Ah!

10:07.290 --> 10:08.510
What is it?

10:08.510 --> 10:12.470
It's time that I go. Thank you very much for today.

10:12.470 --> 10:14.680
Thank you for the pizza.

10:14.680 --> 10:17.560
Kanata onii-tan, Miyu onee-tan,

10:17.560 --> 10:23.400
please give my regards to Wanya onii-tan and Ruu-kun as well.

10:23.400 --> 10:23.940
Thank you.

10:23.940 --> 10:25.180
I'll be sure to tell them.

10:26.060 --> 10:29.100
Well then, Momoka-chan, goodbye.

10:30.350 --> 10:31.990
Do you know your way out?

10:31.990 --> 10:33.280
I'm fine.

10:33.280 --> 10:35.320
Thank you very much.

10:35.320 --> 10:38.120
Do you have a curfew?

10:38.120 --> 10:40.160
Yes, of course.

10:40.160 --> 10:42.670
I mustn't worry my Mama.

10:42.670 --> 10:45.080
I can't be a bad girl.

10:45.490 --> 10:49.590
I guess preschoolers who don't call me "oba-tan" do<i> exist.</i>

10:49.590 --> 10:50.500
Yeah.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.920
Oh? Momoka-chan?

10:53.290 --> 10:54.800
I'm going home too.

10:55.130 --> 10:56.810
Are you going to go home via the back gate?

10:56.810 --> 10:58.050
That's odd.

10:58.050 --> 11:00.480
It's just for a change.

11:00.480 --> 11:04.060
Give my regards to Ruu and Wanya.

11:04.060 --> 11:07.730
Excuse me for the intrusion, Kanata onii-tan, oba-tan.

11:08.060 --> 11:11.200
See? I am<i> an "oba-tan."</i>

11:11.200 --> 11:12.310
Yup.

11:21.240 --> 11:22.830
Excuse me.

11:22.830 --> 11:23.910
Coming.

11:26.380 --> 11:28.830
Good day, Miyu onee-tan.

11:30.120 --> 11:30.870
Welcome.

11:31.960 --> 11:36.250
What? You want to invite Ruu-chama round to your house?

11:36.250 --> 11:40.850
Yes. Mama said I should invite Ruu-kun over for tea.

11:40.850 --> 11:42.130
What do you want to do, Ruu-kun?

11:43.340 --> 11:44.600
What should we do?

11:44.600 --> 11:47.060
Ruu-kun, let's play together!

11:48.390 --> 11:49.440
What should we do?

11:49.440 --> 11:50.900
I think it'll be fine.

11:50.900 --> 11:52.990
Ruu-chama's in a good mood too.

11:52.990 --> 11:56.120
Well, it looks like we'll be visiting you then.

11:56.120 --> 11:56.610
Great!

11:59.320 --> 12:03.000
Ruu-kun will be fine with me.

12:03.000 --> 12:06.120
My tricycle can fit two.

12:06.120 --> 12:10.300
We'd like to meet your parents though.

12:10.300 --> 12:13.540
That's right. Greetings are important.

12:17.500 --> 12:19.170
This is my house.

12:19.250 --> 12:20.260
Wow!

12:20.260 --> 12:22.590
Mama, I'm home.

12:23.180 --> 12:25.680
I'm sorry to have made such an unreasonable request out of the blue.

12:25.680 --> 12:28.110
It's fine. Thank you for inviting us.

12:28.110 --> 12:31.900
Um, Ruu-kun's still a baby, will that be a problem for you?

12:31.900 --> 12:34.600
Oh, don't worry.

12:34.600 --> 12:40.370
We have a pediatric department and you're reliable for your age, aren't you?

12:40.370 --> 12:41.330
Yup!

12:41.330 --> 12:45.660
She really is a quiet, good girl who listens to her parents.

12:45.660 --> 12:50.040
It's got to the point where I wish she'd express her opinions a bit more.

12:50.370 --> 12:51.380
I see...

12:51.380 --> 12:54.210
She was expressing herself nice and loudly earlier on...

12:54.210 --> 12:54.960
Really?

12:54.960 --> 12:59.930
Mama, I'm going to read a book to Ruu-kun in my room.

12:59.930 --> 13:04.510
Is that so? Ruu-kun, play nice with Koume, okay?

13:04.510 --> 13:07.310
I wonder if Ruu-kun will be okay?

13:07.310 --> 13:10.770
I think this will be a good learning experience for Ruu-kun.

13:10.770 --> 13:12.460
Please don't worry.

13:13.430 --> 13:16.610
Koume loves reading more than anything else.

13:16.610 --> 13:19.660
They'll be playing nicely together in the house.

13:19.660 --> 13:24.580
I see... Then please take care of Ruu-kun.

13:24.580 --> 13:26.160
Yes, of course.

13:28.070 --> 13:32.120
Ruu-chama, you mustn't fly or use your psychic powers, okay?

13:33.660 --> 13:39.630
I think that Koume-chan acts like a "good girl"
even more in front of her mother.

13:39.630 --> 13:40.790
Really?

13:40.790 --> 13:42.760
Wanya, you're so slow.

13:43.670 --> 13:45.840
This is my room.

13:46.260 --> 13:49.090
Ruu-kun, please come in.

13:49.470 --> 13:52.860
I've prepared some snacks in the living room.

13:52.860 --> 13:55.680
Don't go outside, okay?

13:55.680 --> 13:56.690
Okay!

13:57.520 --> 13:59.940
Well then, be a good girl, okay?

13:59.940 --> 14:03.030
Now then, Ruu-kun, let's play.

14:03.030 --> 14:04.450
Let's play with the piano.

14:04.450 --> 14:06.820
I'm learning how to play the piano.

14:10.660 --> 14:14.240
They've been positioned nicely, so we're not supposed to move them.

14:15.200 --> 14:20.170
Let's clear this up. I'll bring out my doll set, okay?

14:20.170 --> 14:22.140
My darling Ruu.

14:22.140 --> 14:23.210
Good day.

14:23.210 --> 14:25.670
What? Ruu went out?

14:26.010 --> 14:27.530
Um, yeah. It was a bit sudden.

14:28.180 --> 14:28.810
It's that girl, isn't it?

14:28.810 --> 14:29.130
What?

14:29.130 --> 14:31.270
It's that Koume-chan from yesterday, isn't it?

14:31.270 --> 14:33.110
Um... Maybe...

14:33.110 --> 14:34.110
Momoka-chan?

14:34.110 --> 14:35.980
She was here one step ahead of me.

14:35.980 --> 14:38.070
I won't let her have my Ruu!

14:38.070 --> 14:38.690
Ah...

14:38.690 --> 14:39.560
Momoka-chan?

14:39.560 --> 14:44.440
Oh no! Momoka's planning to barge into Koume-chan's house!

14:45.440 --> 14:49.410
So, Hanakomachi, you're babysitting Momoka-chan today?

14:49.410 --> 14:52.580
Oh, Momoka-chan asked me to accompany her today.

14:52.580 --> 14:57.370
She wanted to invite Ruu-kun round to her house.

14:57.370 --> 15:02.380
Oh? Rivals in love, they really do think alike.

15:02.380 --> 15:06.720
So where are Miyu-san, Mitarashi-san, and that distant relative of yours today?

15:06.720 --> 15:08.760
Oh, they took Ruu over to Koume-chan's.

15:10.840 --> 15:16.180
Which means that Kanata-kun and I are alone together!

15:17.680 --> 15:21.900
This can't be true! To be all alone with Kanata-kun on a Sunday...

15:21.900 --> 15:24.020
Is this a dream or an illusion?

15:24.020 --> 15:27.400
No! No! This is probably reality!

15:28.150 --> 15:32.490
"Hanakomachi-No, when we're alone, can I call you Chris?"

15:32.910 --> 15:34.910
"Of course, Kanata-kun."

15:34.910 --> 15:35.910
"Oh, Chris!"

15:36.410 --> 15:37.790
"Yes, Kanata-kun."

15:38.160 --> 15:40.260
"Even if the sun splits into three or four,

15:40.260 --> 15:44.170
or if bugs breed in the rice bin, if I'm with you, I'm not scared."

15:44.500 --> 15:46.000
"Yes, Kanata-kun!"

15:46.000 --> 15:48.210
And the two hold hands, and...

15:48.210 --> 15:49.840
Hey, Hanakomachi.

15:50.300 --> 15:50.760
Yes?

15:51.130 --> 15:55.140
Sorry, but I have some chores I need to do. I'll see you later.

15:55.140 --> 15:58.650
I'm happy to help you with whatever chores you need to do.

15:58.650 --> 16:00.560
The laundry? The cleaning?

16:00.560 --> 16:02.190
Um... that's...

16:06.480 --> 16:08.620
Oh dear...

16:08.620 --> 16:11.490
I don't know where Koume-chan lives.

16:11.990 --> 16:14.410
I'll use the Momoka Information Source Network to find out!

16:15.820 --> 16:17.880
What's up, Momoka-chan?

16:17.880 --> 16:21.090
I want you to locate Yumenokouji Koume-chan's house.

16:21.090 --> 16:23.470
My boyfriend's been stolen.

16:23.470 --> 16:25.670
Okay. I'll ask around.

16:26.250 --> 16:28.850
Since it's for Momoka-chan, I'll look around.

16:28.850 --> 16:31.860
Yumenokouji? I've heard of that name before...

16:34.760 --> 16:36.640
Yes, this is Momoka.

16:36.640 --> 16:38.060
What? You found it?

16:38.510 --> 16:42.780
Near the Tarafuku Supermarket? The Yumenokouji Medical Clinic?

16:42.780 --> 16:43.940
Thank you.

16:45.520 --> 16:48.400
You're being mean to my doll.

16:50.940 --> 16:52.360
Oh, Ruu-kun, where are you going?

16:55.030 --> 16:57.030
Are you bored, Ruu-kun?

16:58.200 --> 17:00.870
Then let's go and have our snacks.

17:01.250 --> 17:05.290
But before we can do that, good kids tidy up after themselves.

17:07.210 --> 17:10.000
Ruu-kun, say "ah."

17:12.010 --> 17:13.470
It's yummy, isn't it?

17:14.340 --> 17:17.260
I'll feed you, Ruu-kun!

17:19.970 --> 17:23.030
What am I going to do? Mama's going to tell me off.

17:23.030 --> 17:26.560
I spilled juice on the floor. I'm a bad girl.

17:27.860 --> 17:30.020
Oh, you're eating your snacks.

17:31.730 --> 17:33.740
You spilled juice on the floor?

17:33.740 --> 17:35.740
What are you doing? We need to wipe it up quickly.

17:36.360 --> 17:40.460
Oh, no. We're feeding the ticks and molds!

17:40.460 --> 17:42.450
Did you spill it, Koume-chan?

17:43.370 --> 17:44.790
Um... ah....

17:45.960 --> 17:50.420
As Ruu-kun's still a baby, he can't hold the cup well, so...

17:50.420 --> 17:53.680
Oh, so Ruu-kun spilled it?

17:53.680 --> 17:54.630
I understand.

17:55.130 --> 17:58.640
I'll clean up. You two can go and play in your room.

18:04.350 --> 18:05.520
Coming!

18:07.440 --> 18:08.650
Found you!

18:08.650 --> 18:10.110
Momoka-chan...

18:10.980 --> 18:12.980
My darling Ruu!

18:16.490 --> 18:17.990
Wait!

18:20.450 --> 18:22.200
I'll follow her.

18:24.870 --> 18:25.540
Say "ah."

18:25.540 --> 18:26.290
What?

18:26.620 --> 18:29.750
Now, no need to be shy. Say "ah."

18:30.710 --> 18:32.130
Say "ah."

18:32.130 --> 18:33.720
Kanata, I'm home.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.050
Chris-san, welcome.

18:35.050 --> 18:37.990
Ah, this is the usual... you know... that...

18:37.990 --> 18:38.770
That...

18:38.770 --> 18:40.520
It's fine. I wouldn't worry about it.

18:40.520 --> 18:44.570
It's none of my business if Kanata and Chris-chan are getting friendly with each other while I'm out.

18:44.570 --> 18:49.700
My, Miyu-chan, you're so... saying that Kanata-kun and I are really good friends with each other.

18:49.700 --> 18:51.900
Stop trying to make the situation worse.

18:52.560 --> 18:58.280
Kanata-kun said that he wouldn't care if the sun split into three or four if he were with me.

18:58.280 --> 18:59.160
What?

18:59.160 --> 19:03.540
He also said that he would want to be with me even if bugs breed in the rice bin.

19:03.540 --> 19:05.750
Hey, I never said that.

19:05.750 --> 19:09.290
Looks like there's no room for me to comment here.

19:10.330 --> 19:12.760
Yes, yes, I'll answer that.

19:12.760 --> 19:14.550
Yes, this is the Saionji.

19:14.550 --> 19:16.180
Yumenokouji-san?

19:16.180 --> 19:18.220
Oh, thank you for today.

19:18.920 --> 19:22.190
What? Ruu-chama and Koume-san disappeared?

19:22.190 --> 19:22.800
What?!

19:22.800 --> 19:29.600
They're not in the house and Koume left her cell phone behind. I don't know where they went.

19:30.060 --> 19:31.490
Let's split up and look for them!

19:31.490 --> 19:32.070
Yeah.

19:32.070 --> 19:32.650
Yes.

19:37.650 --> 19:38.280
Huh?

19:38.280 --> 19:39.990
Ruu-kun?

19:42.200 --> 19:43.420
I've got a call.

19:43.420 --> 19:44.960
Yes, this is Momoka.

19:44.960 --> 19:47.040
I understand. Thank you.

19:47.040 --> 19:49.250
So, they went that way.

19:53.500 --> 19:57.090
I wonder where we should go...

19:57.920 --> 19:59.970
I can't go home.

19:59.970 --> 20:05.350
I'm a bad girl who broke her promise to her Mama to stay inside.

20:05.350 --> 20:09.650
I'm going to have to live my life as a bad girl.

20:09.650 --> 20:12.150
Ruu! Ruu!

20:12.150 --> 20:12.940
Huh?

20:14.310 --> 20:17.480
Found you! Ruu's my boyfriend!

20:19.440 --> 20:20.660
Momoka-chan...

20:20.660 --> 20:22.400
Let's go, Ruu-kun.

20:27.830 --> 20:28.540
Ruu!

20:31.290 --> 20:32.160
Ruu!

20:34.170 --> 20:37.090
W-What's going on?

20:39.000 --> 20:41.810
What are you going to do if someone sees you, Ruu?

20:41.810 --> 20:43.590
What is this?

20:44.510 --> 20:46.100
Watch out!

20:46.430 --> 20:48.890
No, Ruu. You mustn't fly.

20:52.180 --> 20:54.990
Are you telling me to be friends with Koume-chan?

20:54.990 --> 20:57.150
I have no problems with that.

20:58.270 --> 21:02.620
Momoka-chan, you knew that Ruu-kun could fly?

21:02.620 --> 21:06.670
Of course. I know everything there is to know about Ruu.

21:06.670 --> 21:08.620
After all, I love Ruu.

21:10.870 --> 21:12.580
I lose.

21:14.460 --> 21:15.750
Ah, yes, that's right.

21:16.140 --> 21:22.890
I saw Ruu-kun while sketching in the park, so I called Momoka-chan.

21:22.890 --> 21:27.020
Oh yeah, I should've called your place too, Miyu-chan.

21:27.020 --> 21:28.260
The park she said.

21:28.260 --> 21:31.480
We'll need to contact Kanata-kun and the others.

21:31.480 --> 21:33.180
Thank you, Mikan-san.

21:35.140 --> 21:39.190
When I first saw Ruu-kun, my heart beat so fast.

21:39.690 --> 21:43.540
He's bold, reasonable, and he even guessed the golden lion correctly.

21:43.540 --> 21:44.700
He's wonderful.

21:45.150 --> 21:50.290
I'm always thinking that I need to be a good girl,

21:50.290 --> 21:53.550
so that I don't make Mama and Papa sad... I need to be good all the time...

21:53.550 --> 21:58.340
That's why I was so envious of Ruu-kun and Momoka-chan.

21:58.340 --> 22:00.880
You love Ruu, right?

22:00.880 --> 22:05.520
You love Ruu. You also know that Ruu can fly.

22:05.520 --> 22:07.810
We're friends, okay?

22:07.810 --> 22:09.270
Friends?

22:09.270 --> 22:12.770
But you can't tell anyone that Ruu can fly.

22:12.770 --> 22:15.320
Not even your Papa and Mama.

22:15.320 --> 22:17.530
Is that what a good girl would do?

22:17.530 --> 22:19.740
We're good girls.

22:19.740 --> 22:22.530
I got it. I won't tell anyone.

22:22.530 --> 22:24.410
Good girl.

22:24.410 --> 22:26.070
Ruu!

22:24.410 --> 22:26.070
Momoka-chan!

22:26.070 --> 22:30.620
Koume-chan, didn't you make a promise with Mama not to leave the house?

22:32.620 --> 22:36.620
Why did you break our promise? Did you take Ruu-kun outside?

22:36.620 --> 22:39.630
You're not the type of girl who'd do that, right?

22:39.630 --> 22:41.590
Maybe Ruu-kun took her outside.

22:41.590 --> 22:42.380
That is a possibility.

22:43.670 --> 22:45.140
Koume-chan?

22:45.140 --> 22:47.850
I took Ruu-kun outside.

22:47.850 --> 22:52.860
I'm a bad girl for breaking my promise and worrying Mama.

22:52.860 --> 22:55.390
I'm sorry. Please scold me.

22:55.640 --> 22:56.570
Koume...

22:56.570 --> 22:57.770
I'm sorry!

22:59.060 --> 23:01.520
You're a good girl, Koume.

23:02.310 --> 23:04.690
See? You're a good girl after all.

23:05.400 --> 23:07.030
Before I knew it,

23:07.030 --> 23:13.030
Koume-san and Momoka-san, who were fighting, had become the best of friends.

23:14.080 --> 23:17.120
Friends are nice, aren't they, Ruu-chama?

24:29.940 --> 24:59.960
Next Episode

24:31.740 --> 24:33.480
Following in the footsteps of Seiya-kun, Rui-san, and the Waru Waru Gang,

24:33.480 --> 24:35.320
another visitor has arrived.

24:35.320 --> 24:37.910
There have been quite a few visitors from the planet Sharak.

24:37.910 --> 24:41.410
I wonder if they're getting carried away?

24:41.410 --> 24:43.670
He's a detective from the Galaxy Police, right?

24:43.670 --> 24:44.880
He's exhausting to be around.

24:44.880 --> 24:46.540
Next time on Daa Daa Daa:

24:46.540 --> 24:47.920
Teru of Planet Sharak Visits.

24:47.920 --> 24:49.840
Rui-san doesn't like this either...

24:49.840 --> 24:52.800
How do you say this... It's like he can't see how others see him.

24:53.970 --> 24:55.590
I'll have to tell her!

24:55.590 --> 24:56.390
Please don't.
